OL,3,ASpecies 'at risk of vanishing' from
OL,4,Aarea of Wales' largest national park
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of Wales' most endangered species
OL,7,Fare "at risk of vanishing" from an area
OL,8,Fof the country's largest national park,
OL,9,Fexperts have warned.
OL,11,FThe National Trust said Nant Ffrancon,
OL,12,Fa valley in Eryri National Park, was
OL,13,Ffacing "serious ecological decline"
OL,14,Fwith some species in danger of
OL,15,Fdisappearing altogether, including the
OL,16,Fmountain blackbird and the mountain
OL,17,Ffinch.
OL,19,FNow, a new #1m scheme is aiming to
OL,20,Frestore and conserve more than 4,000
OL,21,Facres of habitats at Eryri, also known
OL,22,Fas Snowdonia.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
