OL,3,ASpecies 'at risk of vanishing' from
OL,4,Aarea of Wales' largest national park
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're in a very serious situation -
OL,7,Fwe're in a nature emergency. There are
OL,8,Fso many species in this valley which
OL,9,Fare on the brink of extinction," said
OL,10,FSimon Rogers from the National Trust.
